---

<header
  class="relative bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] pt-16 lg:pt-24 pb-12 sm:pb-16 px-6 lg:px-12 text-center overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20"
>
  <div
    class="absolute top-10 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-[var(--cor-destaque)]/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto z-10">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
      <span
        class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
      >
        Menu de Cuidados
      </span>
      <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.5rem] text-[var(--cor-texto)] leading-[1.15] mb-5 tracking-tight"
    >
      Tudo para te sentires <span
        class="italic font-normal text-[var(--cor-destaque)]">tu+ bonita</span
      >
    </h1>

    <p
      class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto"
    >
      Unhas, depilação, olhar, cabelo, rosto e massagens — protocolos executados
      com cosmética de alta gama e atenção personalizada.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>
